---
import Terminal from '../layouts/Terminal.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/portrait.png';
const record = [
    ['NAME', 'Elijah (Eli) Roussos'],
    ['LOCATION', 'New York, NY <-> Cape Town, ZA'],
    ['EDUCATION', 'MEng ECE, Cornell · BSc (Hons) CS, UCT'],
];
---
<Terminal title="About" section="about">
    <h1>ABOUT</h1>
    <section class="personnel" aria-label="Personnel record">
        <figure class="portrait">
            <img src={portrait.src} width={portrait.width} height={portrait.height}
                alt="Eli Roussos, rendered in green terminal pixels" />
            <figcaption>IMG-0001 · ROUSSOS, E.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="personnel-body">
            <dl class="personnel-record">
                {record.map(([field, value]) => <div><dt>{field}</dt><dd>{value}</dd></div>)}
            </dl>
            <div class="prose">
        <p>I'm Eli.</p>
        <p>
            I am a <a href="/resume/">software engineer</a> by trade, and while I love programming, distributed systems, and <a href="/papers/">machine learning</a>, I have a passion for music, video games, and sports.
        </p>
        <p>
            I play guitar (above averagely) and produce music in FL Studio (averagely), though I'm trying to learn Bitwig and Logic at the moment! Some of my favourite artists
            are the Gorillaz, The Ink Spots, Sub Focus, King Gizzard and the Lizard Wizard, Tool, and Improvement Movement.
        </p>
        <p>
            I love a variety of games: Pokémon ROM Hacks on my little handheld emulator, RPGs like Baldur's Gate 3 and Fallout (obviously), Metroidvanias like Hollow Knight, strategy like Warcraft 3 and
            Civ V, platformers like Celeste, roguelikes like Hades and Binding of Isaac, FPS variety à la DOOM and Dishonored, & MOBAs like Dota and recently, Deadlock!
        </p>
        <p>
            Looking to play The Witcher 3, Rogue Trader, Expedition 33, and Elden Ring (and let's be honest, probably more Deadlock).
        </p>
        <p>
            Love Padel and Tennis (especially Wimbledon), if wanna hit up a game to play let me know! An obligatory 🧡LET'S GO KNICKS💙 and 💚LET'S GO BOKKE💛! Don't catch me missing those games.
        </p>
        <p>
            I also take photos, which go on Instagram as <a href="https://www.instagram.com/eli_takes_photos/">@eli_takes_photos</a> and on the <a href="/instagram/">Photos screen</a> on this site.
        </p>
        <p>
            If I am not doing any of these things, I am probably coding/swarming my agents. Check out some of my <a href="/projects/">Projects</a>! Particularly
            interesting are <a href="/projects/surfsk8s/">surfsk8s</a>, <a href="/projects/agent-kit/">agent-kit</a>, <a href="/projects/pedalboi/">PedalBoi</a> and <a href="/projects/icloud-photos-cli/">icloud-photos-cli</a>.
            I am a Zig/Elixir/Go/Rust fanboy, but have built apps, systems, backends, CLIs, and all sorts in Clojure, Java, C++, C#, Swift, TypeScript and Python. Hopefully looking to get into some OCaml
            by the end of this year, though I am mostly concerned with overall systems and picking the right tool for the job! Stacks are a means to an end.
        </p>
        <p>
            Feel free to reach out on socials! Links are at the bottom.
        </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</Terminal>
